    "setupAssumption": "Approximate production setup allowance derived from the green benchmark job's common checkout/runtime/dependency steps. HyperFrames gets an extra browser/bootstrap allowance. HyperFrames lint/check QA time is intentionally excluded from per-customer production rendering."
